COMMENT ON COLUMN public.pppp_automation_http_runs.request_id IS 'pg_net request identifier used to correlate an in-flight managed HTTP run with net._http_response. It is intentionally non-unique across retained PPPP history because pg_net IDs can be reused after queue/extension reset; correlation_id + attempt remains the durable run identity.';


